Subject: [PATCH 30/40] audit(proofs): regenerate AllAxioms.lean / theorems.txt
 after the CC-01 proof repair

strict_gate.sh regenerates both files from the sources on every run; the
CC-01 proof repair moved theorem lines in Correct.lean and
EngineProofs.lean (same 79 theorems, only line numbers change), so the
committed copies are refreshed to keep the tree clean after verify.sh.

